# FrappeOps agent rules

- Develop only against the control site `frappeops.local` unless the user explicitly directs otherwise.
- Never drop, uninstall, or destructively migrate the protected site `ss.frappe.my`.
- Do not invent credentials; do not commit secrets.
- Do not present unimplemented operations as working.
- Prefer service modules under `frappeops/services/` for domain logic.
- All infrastructure mutations must be representable as auditable Operation Jobs.
- Ask before nginx/SSL/DNS/firewall/SSH or any production-impacting change.
